            <ATTRIBUTE-VALUE-XHTML>
              <DEFINITION><ATTRIBUTE-DEFINITION-XHTML-REF>_53c969acbb77c12b793b52095a0ca59c</ATTRIBUTE-DEFINITION-XHTML-REF></DEFINITION>
              <THE-VALUE><xhtml:div>Closes on the 20th, pays on the 10th of the next month. When the payment day is closed, pays on the business day before</xhtml:div></THE-VALUE>
